 248:USB_DEVICE/App/usbd_cdc_if.c **** /**
 249:USB_DEVICE/App/usbd_cdc_if.c ****   * @brief  Data received over USB OUT endpoint are sent over CDC interface
 250:USB_DEVICE/App/usbd_cdc_if.c ****   *         through this function.
 251:USB_DEVICE/App/usbd_cdc_if.c ****   *
 252:USB_DEVICE/App/usbd_cdc_if.c ****   *         @note
 253:USB_DEVICE/App/usbd_cdc_if.c ****   *         This function will issue a NAK packet on any OUT packet received on
 254:USB_DEVICE/App/usbd_cdc_if.c ****   *         USB endpoint until exiting this function. If you exit this function
 255:USB_DEVICE/App/usbd_cdc_if.c ****   *         before transfer is complete on CDC interface (ie. using DMA controller)
 256:USB_DEVICE/App/usbd_cdc_if.c ****   *         it will result in receiving more data while previous ones are still
 257:USB_DEVICE/App/usbd_cdc_if.c ****   *         not sent.
 258:USB_DEVICE/App/usbd_cdc_if.c ****   *
 259:USB_DEVICE/App/usbd_cdc_if.c ****   * @param  Buf: Buffer of data to be received
